# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF, so CI on Linux and a
# checkout on Windows agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are byte-exact on purpose. Some of them test how the analyser
# handles CRLF, BOMs and unusual encodings; normalising them would rewrite
# the very thing under test and the assertion would quietly pass forever.
tests/fixtures/** -text
